# print(Object.create(new Proxy({}, { set() { return true; } })));
# A control of proxy-over-a-handler-written-in-place-without-a-get-trap-answers-what-its-target-answers.ir: `get` is opened on Object.prototype, and what is laid there the handler inherits.
